<!-- 20D east corridor (2F), Jill. Common 0x61..0x64 are Richard's.

     The first entry plays Richard's scene (event_01): it sets common 0x62
     (he waits, poisoned), sets common 0x23 (the serum in 100 is on offer
     again) and zeroes state word 4, the seconds counter. While 0x62 is set
     and 0x61 clear, room main turns the door to 20E (AOT 1) into a message,
     so the way on waits on Richard.

     On a later entry with the serum held and word 4 at most 420 (seven
     minutes), init sets 0x63 and clears 0x64; walking into camera 3 (state
     byte 2 == 3, Richard's cut) then runs event_02, which takes the serum
     and sets 0x61, in both games. 0x63 alone is no hand-over: the bot
     that took it for one left 20D, and the next entry found Richard dead.
     Past 420 seconds the entry sets 0x64 instead (Richard dies).

     Chris's game, after Yawn's bite in 210: Chris collapses in 20E and play
     switches to Rebecca in 20D (common 0x5F, the serum run, timer W_04).
     Door 1 to 20E is a message until she holds the serum from 100; then it
     is her event that takes it to Chris. Back under 300 seconds he is cured
     (common 0x5E); past it the run is a game over.

     Richard dead (common 0x64, set by an entry past 420 seconds), in both
     games: his scene closes (0x61) only when the camera next cuts to him
     (cut 3) on that entry or a later one. Until then the door to 20E stays
     a message, and in Chris's game 10F's piano says there is no time to
     play. Nothing outside 20D shows the timer running out, so the bot
     comes back once Richard has waited past it (the revisit, timed from
     0x62 with a margin for the doors and menus the counter skips). -->
<bot format="2">
  <deliver item="0x42" cut="3" bank="1" bit="0x61" after_bank="1" after_bit="0x62"
           when="richard=save" label="the serum to Richard"/>
  <deliver item="0x42" slot="1" bank="1" bit="0x5E" after_bank="1" after_bit="0x5F"
           character="chris" label="Rebecca brings Chris the serum"/>
  <camera cut="3" bank="1" bit="0x61" after_bank="1" after_bit="0x64"
          label="Richard's body: his scene closes"/>
  <revisit bank="1" bit="0x61" while="clear" after_bank="1" after_bit="0x62"
           after_seconds="430" label="Richard's seven minutes are up"/>
</bot>
